const html = "<p>Time and Labor functionality in Oracle Fusion HCM manages employee work hours, attendance, and timekeeping requirements across the organization.</p>\n<h2 id=\"time-and-labor-architecture\">Time and Labor Architecture</h2>\n<p>The Time and Labor module integrates:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Time entry and tracking</li>\n<li>Attendance management</li>\n<li>Leave administration</li>\n<li>Payroll integration</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"timesheet-configuration\">Timesheet Configuration</h2>\n<p>Establish timesheet structure for your organization:</p>\n<h3 id=\"timesheet-period\">Timesheet Period</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Duration: Weekly, bi-weekly, monthly</li>\n<li>Start and end dates</li>\n<li>Approval deadlines</li>\n<li>Payment period alignment</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"work-schedule\">Work Schedule</h3>\n<p>Define expected work patterns:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Full-time schedules</li>\n<li>Part-time arrangements</li>\n<li>Shift-based work</li>\n<li>Flexible schedules</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"recording-time-entries\">Recording Time Entries</h2>\n<p>Employees submit time through various methods:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mobile applications</li>\n<li>Web-based timesheets</li>\n<li>Time clocks</li>\n<li>Integration with badge systems</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"entry-types\">Entry Types</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Regular Hours: Standard work time</li>\n<li>Overtime: Time exceeding normal hours</li>\n<li>Leave: Absence periods</li>\n<li>Adjustments: Corrections to prior entries</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"attendance-management\">Attendance Management</h2>\n<p>Track and manage employee presence:</p>\n<h3 id=\"attendance-policies\">Attendance Policies</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Punctuality requirements</li>\n<li>Absence reporting procedures</li>\n<li>Documentation requirements</li>\n<li>Disciplinary actions</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"absence-types\">Absence Types</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Paid Time Off</li>\n<li>Unpaid Leave</li>\n<li>Sick Leave</li>\n<li>Bereavement</li>\n<li>Maternity/Paternity</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"leave-administration\">Leave Administration</h2>\n<p>Manage leave entitlements and accruals:</p>\n<h3 id=\"leave-setup\">Leave Setup</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Accrual rules: How leave is earned</li>\n<li>Carryover: Unused leave handling</li>\n<li>Usage restrictions: When leave applies</li>\n<li>Documentation: Supporting records</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"leave-request-process\">Leave Request Process</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Employee requests leave</li>\n<li>Manager approval</li>\n<li>Leave deduction from balance</li>\n<li>Payroll notification</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"approval-workflows\">Approval Workflows</h2>\n<p>Establish multi-level approval structures:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Manager review and approval</li>\n<li>Department head sign-off</li>\n<li>Compliance validation</li>\n<li>Final authorization</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"payroll-integration\">Payroll Integration</h2>\n<p>Time and labor data flows to payroll:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hours worked calculations</li>\n<li>Overtime identification</li>\n<li>Leave processing</li>\n<li>Earnings determination</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"reporting-capabilities\">Reporting Capabilities</h2>\n<p>Time and Labor generates reports for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Timesheet Summary: Hours by employee</li>\n<li>Attendance Report: Presence tracking</li>\n<li>Leave Usage: Accrual and consumption</li>\n<li>Payroll Input: Hour submission to payroll</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"compliance-considerations\">Compliance Considerations</h2>\n<p>Ensure compliance with labor regulations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Wage and hour laws</li>\n<li>Overtime regulations</li>\n<li>Leave requirements</li>\n<li>Accessibility requirements</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"best-practices\">Best Practices</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Establish clear policies</strong> communicated to all employees</li>\n<li><strong>Configure approval workflows</strong> matching organization</li>\n<li><strong>Integrate with payroll</strong> for accurate processing</li>\n<li><strong>Monitor exceptions</strong> for policy violations</li>\n<li><strong>Maintain audit trails</strong> for compliance</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"conclusion\">Conclusion</h2>\n<p>Proper Time and Labor configuration ensures accurate hour tracking, compliance with regulations, and seamless payroll processing. Invest in clear policies and thorough implementation for optimal results.</p>";

